<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83038" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῖαρ</span></b> , τό, only nom.
		and acc. (exc. dat. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίαρι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			) : (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίων</span>)
			:—<i>fat</i>, 
				Ep.
			 and 
				Ion.
			 word, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῶν ἐκ πῖαρ ἑλέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.550
				</span></i>
			 ; of men, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat. Puer.</u>
				21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>any fatty substance</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐλαίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1133
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. μελιηδές</span> prob.
				<i>cream,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.224
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
				36.21
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦαρ</span> Pap. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
			</span></i>); <i>thick juice</i> from trees, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Puer.</u>
				26
			</span></i>; of the fig, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.205
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ulc.</u>
				15
			</span></i> ; <i>richness</i> of soil, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεὶ μάλα π. ὑπ᾽ οὖδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.135
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				60
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθλῆς ἀρούρης π. ἔγκληρον χθονός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					1060
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.555
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>cream, choicest part</i> of a thing, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ven.</u>
				30
			</span></i>.</div>
